  "goodToKnow": "Ausreden means to finish speaking: Lass mich ausreden! (let me finish!), a phrase heard in every German TV debate. Jemanden ausreden lassen is basic politeness. It also means to talk someone out of something: Ich habe ihm den Plan ausgeredet. Die Ausrede is an excuse: Das ist doch nur eine Ausrede! The opposite of ausreden is einreden: jemandem etwas einreden (to talk someone into believing something)."
